18218-task_get_state Read the goal, plan and findings back.
18219-These four are per-chat persistent working memory. A long task — research a company, run a backtest sweep,
18220:reconcile a book — outlives any single model context; without somewhere to put the goal and the findings, the agent
18221-forgets what it was doing halfway and starts over. The spine is registered alongside the meta tools as always-
